   </title>
   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results achieved</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats atteints</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">Parmi les r&#xe9;sultats obtenus jusqu&apos;en mai 2022 : 1) publication d&apos;une s&#xe9;rie de podcasts en sept &#xe9;pisodes; 2) publication du rapport &quot; Nowhere to Hide &quot; destin&#xe9; au public; 3) int&#xe9;gration r&#xe9;ussie des donn&#xe9;es de source ouverte dans les rapports de l&apos;&#xe9;quipe d&apos;investigation et d&apos;identification de l&apos;Organisation pour l&apos;interdiction des armes chimiques.</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results achieved as of May 2022 include: (1) published seven-episode podcast series; (2) published the &#x201c;Nowhere to Hide&#x201d; public-facing report; and (3) successfully integrated the open-source data into the Organisation for the Prohibition of Chemical Weapons Investigation and Identification Team reports.</narrative>
    </description>
   </indicator>
  </result>
  <result type="2">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expected Results</narrative>
    <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results expected</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">Les r&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s de ce projet comprennent : 1) des m&#xe9;canismes internationaux renforc&#xe9;s pour attribuer les attaques aux armes chimiques en Syrie; 2) une r&#xe9;ponse renforc&#xe9;e &#xe0; la d&#xe9;sinformation li&#xe9;e &#xe0; l&#x2019;utilisation d&#x2019;armes chimiques en Syrie.</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">The expected outcomes for this project include: (1) strengthened international mechanisms to attribute chemical weapons attacks in Syria; and (2) strengthened response to disinformation related to chemical weapons use in Syria.</narrative>
    </description>
   </indicator>
